.\about.html:30:        <p class="placeholder-text">Those questions grew out of something often overlooked in the donor experience. A receipt may confirm that a donation was successful, and a report may describe the good an organization accomplishes, but neither can replace hearing directly from a recipient about the difference it made. Ovis Alms Foundation was founded on the conviction that this missing voice is essential to completing the charitable continuum. GraManna, now in development, is the mobile-friendly digital platform through which we hope to bring that vision to life.</p>
