.\logs\codex-20261027T1616403062430Z-0cfb95f753a8476ea7f0c37f2d141883.log:675:The GraManna application is currently being developed primarily as an online web application. Android and Apple iOS versions are potential future releases.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1616403062430Z-0cfb95f753a8476ea7f0c37f2d141883.log:681:A visitor may discover GraManna through either:
