.\logs\codex-20261027T1616403062430Z-0cfb95f753a8476ea7f0c37f2d141883.log:686:Visitors should not have to know which organization website or application they should visit to express interest in GraManna.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1616403062430Z-0cfb95f753a8476ea7f0c37f2d141883.log:690:The GraManna admin dashboard should provide a combined view of activity from both entry points.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1616403062430Z-0cfb95f753a8476ea7f0c37f2d141883.log:700:Visitors can select a state and submit a request expressing interest in GraManna availability.
