.\logs\codex-20261027T1616403062430Z-0cfb95f753a8476ea7f0c37f2d141883.log:706:Add a State Request feature to the public-facing GraManna homepage.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1616403062430Z-0cfb95f753a8476ea7f0c37f2d141883.log:708:This serves people who discover GraManna directly without first visiting the foundation website.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1616403062430Z-0cfb95f753a8476ea7f0c37f2d141883.log:726:GraManna should communicate through an appropriately secured server-side integration, rather than accessing OAF PostgreSQL directly from the public browser.
