.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:1760:The current `Invoke-OAFCodex` helper accepts these modes:
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:1952:Unsubscribe links use `/gramanna.html#unsubscribe=<hash>.<signature>`. Fragments stay out of HTTP paths/query logs, are removed from the address bar immediately, and require explicit user action. POST the signed token with the same origin and browser CSRF protections. No email address is needed to withdraw; invalid signatures cannot mutate, and successful repeated/unknown valid receipts produce a generic confirmation. Future approved delivery can recreate links with `UnsubscribeCapabilities.issue(stored_digest)` using the same protected key. No email delivery/verification is implemented or claimed.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:1954:Offline validation adds `tests/test_notifications.py` and `tests/test_notification_migration.py` to the ten-file suite, preserving `-B`, the dedicated website interpreter, empty pytest plugin/options settings and `-p migration_offline`. Select all twelve test files explicitly. Synthetic operational approvals/authorizations remain restricted to test temporary directories; they are not owner issuance. Browser checks use `..\GraManna\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -B tests/notification_browser_check.py` and the existing State Request browser check, with intercepted requests and no database access or GraManna repository edits.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:1962:Task file inventory: `gramanna.html`, `assets/notifications.js`; `oaf_website/notifications.py`, `oaf_website/notification_schema.py`, `oaf_website/notification_validation.py`, `oaf_website/state_requests.py`, `oaf_website/local_testing.py`; `migrations/versions/0003_notifications.py`, `migrations/manifest.json`, `oaf_website/migration_validation.py`, `oaf_website/migration_authority.py`; `tests/test_notifications.py`, `tests/test_notification_migration.py`, `tests/notification_browser_check.py`, `tests/migration_offline.py`, `tests/test_migration_artifacts.py`, `tests/test_migration_authorization.py`, `tests/state_request_browser_check.py`; `docs/WEBSITE_PLAN.md`, `docs/WORKFLOW.md`. No task edits to pre-existing owner changes or approved revisions were made.
