.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2091:## OAF Website and GraManna Γö£├│╬ô├⌐┬╝╬ô├ç┬Ñ Shared Public Services and Admin Integration
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2095:**Repositories:** OAF Website and GraManna (separate repositories)  
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2102:1. **State Requests:** Visitors can express interest in GraManna becoming available in their state.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2115:The GraManna application is currently being developed primarily as an online web application. Android and Apple iOS versions are potential future releases.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2121:A visitor may discover GraManna through either:
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2124:- The GraManna web application's public homepage.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2126:Visitors should not have to know which organization website or application they should visit to express interest in GraManna.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2130:The GraManna admin dashboard should provide a combined view of activity from both entry points.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2140:Visitors can select a state and submit a request expressing interest in GraManna availability.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2144:#### GraManna Web Application Homepage
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2146:Add a State Request feature to the public-facing GraManna homepage.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2148:This serves people who discover GraManna directly without first visiting the foundation website.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2166:GraManna should communicate through an appropriately secured server-side integration, rather than accessing OAF PostgreSQL directly from the public browser.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2168:Do not create a second independent GraManna State Request database that later requires synchronization or reconciliation.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2177:- `gramanna_web`
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2193:Do not confuse the State Request feature with GraManna user eligibility or social feature access. This integration must not introduce unintended eligibility restrictions.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2195:### 4. Android and Apple iOS Γö£├│╬ô├⌐┬╝╬ô├ç┬Ñ Adaptive GraManna Homepage
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2197:The GraManna online web application should include dedicated sections for its future mobile versions.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2205:**GraManna for Android Γö£├│╬ô├⌐┬╝╬ô├ç┬Ñ Coming Soon**
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2217:**Get GraManna on Google Play**
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2225:**GraManna for Apple iOS Γö£├│╬ô├⌐┬╝╬ô├ç┬Ñ Coming Soon**
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2237:**Download GraManna on the App Store**
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2286:The GraManna web homepage should reuse that service rather than creating a separate mailing list or subscriber database.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2299:#### GraManna Web Homepage
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2320:- Do not transfer subscriber email addresses into GraManna merely for admin statistics.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2327:### 7. Unified GraManna Admin Dashboard
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2329:The existing GraManna admin dashboard should become the primary location for viewing aggregate activity from both public entry points.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2333:**OAF Website & GraManna Public Interest**
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2341:- Optional breakdown by OAF Website versus GraManna homepage.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2367:Only appropriately authorized GraManna administrators may access these statistics.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2375:Prefer GraManna's existing admin dashboard layout and navigation conventions rather than introducing a separate admin application.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2377:Follow existing GraManna admin pagination requirements wherever individual tabular records are involved.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2381:Keep the OAF Website and GraManna repositories and their application responsibilities separate.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2390:GraManna Public Homepage
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2391:    -> GraManna Backend
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2399:GraManna Public Homepage
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2400:    -> GraManna Backend
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2407:    -> GraManna Backend
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2408:    -> Existing GraManna Admin Dashboard
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2433:The GraManna admin dashboard must clearly identify the environment from which statistics are being retrieved.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2480:- GraManna public homepage structure.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2481:- GraManna backend integration conventions.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2482:- Existing GraManna admin dashboard and authorization model.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2504:Implement the shared State Request entry point on the GraManna homepage.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2506:Connect the GraManna admin dashboard to combined authoritative State Request statistics.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2514:Add Android and Apple iOS sections to the GraManna public homepage.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2535:- No regressions to completed OAF Website features or GraManna workflows.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2568:GraManna Cargo 22 and other existing Cargo commitments must not be interrupted or silently expanded.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2570:Any necessary changes to existing GraManna contracts should follow the applicable contract-first workflow and owner approval requirements.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2580:A visitor discovers GraManna through the foundation website or directly through the GraManna web application.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2582:If GraManna is not yet available in the visitor's state, the visitor can submit a State Request through either public entry point.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2586:The GraManna admin dashboard displays the combined request totals by state.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2588:On the GraManna web homepage, Android and Apple iOS each initially offer release notifications.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2594:All subscription activity is maintained by one authoritative notification system, and aggregate subscription statistics are viewable from the GraManna admin dashboard.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1826474032617Z-9635c115aa66492287ed09ea37104851.log:2596:The result is a coordinated OAF Website and GraManna experience without duplicate services, unnecessary administrative work, or conflicting statistics.
