.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:893:## OAF Website and GraManna Γö£├│╬ô├⌐┬╝╬ô├ç┬Ñ Shared Public Services and Admin Integration
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:897:**Repositories:** OAF Website and GraManna (separate repositories)  
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:904:1. **State Requests:** Visitors can express interest in GraManna becoming available in their state.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:917:The GraManna application is currently being developed primarily as an online web application. Android and Apple iOS versions are potential future releases.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:923:A visitor may discover GraManna through either:
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:926:- The GraManna web application's public homepage.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:928:Visitors should not have to know which organization website or application they should visit to express interest in GraManna.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:932:The GraManna admin dashboard should provide a combined view of activity from both entry points.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:942:Visitors can select a state and submit a request expressing interest in GraManna availability.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:946:#### GraManna Web Application Homepage
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:948:Add a State Request feature to the public-facing GraManna homepage.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:950:This serves people who discover GraManna directly without first visiting the foundation website.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:968:GraManna should communicate through an appropriately secured server-side integration, rather than accessing OAF PostgreSQL directly from the public browser.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:970:Do not create a second independent GraManna State Request database that later requires synchronization or reconciliation.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:979:- `gramanna_web`
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:995:Do not confuse the State Request feature with GraManna user eligibility or social feature access. This integration must not introduce unintended eligibility restrictions.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:997:### 4. Android and Apple iOS Γö£├│╬ô├⌐┬╝╬ô├ç┬Ñ Adaptive GraManna Homepage
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:999:The GraManna online web application should include dedicated sections for its future mobile versions.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:1007:**GraManna for Android Γö£├│╬ô├⌐┬╝╬ô├ç┬Ñ Coming Soon**
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:1019:**Get GraManna on Google Play**
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:1027:**GraManna for Apple iOS Γö£├│╬ô├⌐┬╝╬ô├ç┬Ñ Coming Soon**
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:1039:**Download GraManna on the App Store**
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:1088:The GraManna web homepage should reuse that service rather than creating a separate mailing list or subscriber database.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:1101:#### GraManna Web Homepage
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:1122:- Do not transfer subscriber email addresses into GraManna merely for admin statistics.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:1129:### 7. Unified GraManna Admin Dashboard
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:1131:The existing GraManna admin dashboard should become the primary location for viewing aggregate activity from both public entry points.
