.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:1169:Only appropriately authorized GraManna administrators may access these statistics.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:1177:Prefer GraManna's existing admin dashboard layout and navigation conventions rather than introducing a separate admin application.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:1179:Follow existing GraManna admin pagination requirements wherever individual tabular records are involved.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:1183:Keep the OAF Website and GraManna repositories and their application responsibilities separate.
