.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:1372:Any necessary changes to existing GraManna contracts should follow the applicable contract-first workflow and owner approval requirements.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:1382:A visitor discovers GraManna through the foundation website or directly through the GraManna web application.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1656432870936Z-51a5e947e47246b895026cb1cb5b118a.log:1384:If GraManna is not yet available in the visitor's state, the visitor can submit a State Request through either public entry point.
