.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2109:## OAF Website and GraManna Γö£├│╬ô├⌐┬╝╬ô├ç┬Ñ Shared Public Services and Admin Integration
.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2113:**Repositories:** OAF Website and GraManna (separate repositories)  
.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2120:1. **State Requests:** Visitors can express interest in GraManna becoming available in their state.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2133:The GraManna application is currently being developed primarily as an online web application. Android and Apple iOS versions are potential future releases.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2139:A visitor may discover GraManna through either:
.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2142:- The GraManna web application's public homepage.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2144:Visitors should not have to know which organization website or application they should visit to express interest in GraManna.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2148:The GraManna admin dashboard should provide a combined view of activity from both entry points.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2158:Visitors can select a state and submit a request expressing interest in GraManna availability.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2162:#### GraManna Web Application Homepage
.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2164:Add a State Request feature to the public-facing GraManna homepage.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2166:This serves people who discover GraManna directly without first visiting the foundation website.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2184:GraManna should communicate through an appropriately secured server-side integration, rather than accessing OAF PostgreSQL directly from the public browser.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2186:Do not create a second independent GraManna State Request database that later requires synchronization or reconciliation.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2195:- `gramanna_web`
.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2211:Do not confuse the State Request feature with GraManna user eligibility or social feature access. This integration must not introduce unintended eligibility restrictions.
.\logs\codex-20261027T1744025362225Z-5c397153e00f41e7888200ee2fd52bcf.log:2213:### 4. Android and Apple iOS Γö£├│╬ô├⌐┬╝╬ô├ç┬Ñ Adaptive GraManna Homepage
