.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2586:## OAF Website and GraManna Γö£├│╬ô├⌐┬╝╬ô├ç┬Ñ Shared Public Services and Admin Integration
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2590:**Repositories:** OAF Website and GraManna (separate repositories)  
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2597:1. **State Requests:** Visitors can express interest in GraManna becoming available in their state.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2610:The GraManna application is currently being developed primarily as an online web application. Android and Apple iOS versions are potential future releases.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2616:A visitor may discover GraManna through either:
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2619:- The GraManna web application's public homepage.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2621:Visitors should not have to know which organization website or application they should visit to express interest in GraManna.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2625:The GraManna admin dashboard should provide a combined view of activity from both entry points.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2635:Visitors can select a state and submit a request expressing interest in GraManna availability.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2639:#### GraManna Web Application Homepage
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2641:Add a State Request feature to the public-facing GraManna homepage.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2643:This serves people who discover GraManna directly without first visiting the foundation website.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2661:GraManna should communicate through an appropriately secured server-side integration, rather than accessing OAF PostgreSQL directly from the public browser.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2663:Do not create a second independent GraManna State Request database that later requires synchronization or reconciliation.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2672:- `gramanna_web`
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2688:Do not confuse the State Request feature with GraManna user eligibility or social feature access. This integration must not introduce unintended eligibility restrictions.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2690:### 4. Android and Apple iOS Γö£├│╬ô├⌐┬╝╬ô├ç┬Ñ Adaptive GraManna Homepage
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2692:The GraManna online web application should include dedicated sections for its future mobile versions.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2700:**GraManna for Android Γö£├│╬ô├⌐┬╝╬ô├ç┬Ñ Coming Soon**
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2712:**Get GraManna on Google Play**
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2720:**GraManna for Apple iOS Γö£├│╬ô├⌐┬╝╬ô├ç┬Ñ Coming Soon**
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2732:**Download GraManna on the App Store**
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2781:The GraManna web homepage should reuse that service rather than creating a separate mailing list or subscriber database.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2794:#### GraManna Web Homepage
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2815:- Do not transfer subscriber email addresses into GraManna merely for admin statistics.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2822:### 7. Unified GraManna Admin Dashboard
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2824:The existing GraManna admin dashboard should become the primary location for viewing aggregate activity from both public entry points.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2828:**OAF Website & GraManna Public Interest**
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2836:- Optional breakdown by OAF Website versus GraManna homepage.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2862:Only appropriately authorized GraManna administrators may access these statistics.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2870:Prefer GraManna's existing admin dashboard layout and navigation conventions rather than introducing a separate admin application.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2872:Follow existing GraManna admin pagination requirements wherever individual tabular records are involved.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2876:Keep the OAF Website and GraManna repositories and their application responsibilities separate.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2885:GraManna Public Homepage
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2886:    -> GraManna Backend
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2894:GraManna Public Homepage
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2895:    -> GraManna Backend
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2902:    -> GraManna Backend
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2903:    -> Existing GraManna Admin Dashboard
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2928:The GraManna admin dashboard must clearly identify the environment from which statistics are being retrieved.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2975:- GraManna public homepage structure.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2976:- GraManna backend integration conventions.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2977:- Existing GraManna admin dashboard and authorization model.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:2999:Implement the shared State Request entry point on the GraManna homepage.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:3001:Connect the GraManna admin dashboard to combined authoritative State Request statistics.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:3009:Add Android and Apple iOS sections to the GraManna public homepage.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:3030:- No regressions to completed OAF Website features or GraManna workflows.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:3063:GraManna Cargo 22 and other existing Cargo commitments must not be interrupted or silently expanded.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:3065:Any necessary changes to existing GraManna contracts should follow the applicable contract-first workflow and owner approval requirements.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:3075:A visitor discovers GraManna through the foundation website or directly through the GraManna web application.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:3077:If GraManna is not yet available in the visitor's state, the visitor can submit a State Request through either public entry point.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:3081:The GraManna admin dashboard displays the combined request totals by state.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:3083:On the GraManna web homepage, Android and Apple iOS each initially offer release notifications.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:3089:All subscription activity is maintained by one authoritative notification system, and aggregate subscription statistics are viewable from the GraManna admin dashboard.
.\logs\codex-20261027T2219591905849Z-74d619fe066b45f485a0806bef75d312.log:3091:The result is a coordinated OAF Website and GraManna experience without duplicate services, unnecessary administrative work, or conflicting statistics.
