.\logs\codex-20261027T2136388310238Z-ed956557521e4ee68b5c6d7e5658cc7f.log:2702:Unsubscribe links use `/gramanna.html#unsubscribe=<hash>.<signature>`. Fragments stay out of HTTP paths/query logs, are removed from the address bar immediately, and require explicit user action. POST the signed token with the same origin and browser CSRF protections. No email address is needed to withdraw; invalid signatures cannot mutate, and successful repeated/unknown valid receipts produce a generic confirmation. Future approved delivery can recreate links with `UnsubscribeCapabilities.issue(stored_digest)` using the same protected key. No email delivery/verification is implemented or claimed.
